{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've probably been there - the holiday family dinner that slowly chips away at your sanity. That kind of awful-but-nostalgic experience, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a masochistic trip down memory lane and relive all the awkward moments and infuriating relatives in <i>Family Dinner</i>. In this narrative-driven experience, you'll actually get to resolve those unresolved family dramas at the dinner table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't take too long! Complete all your missions and escape before your social battery runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A teenage sister in the throes of puberty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bro, aka Mama's boy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inappropriate uncle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's theatrics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066160?t=1761781799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/164dc3ee6399da1615b336ce20ab0b2b4d6fed89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761781799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/33ae9e2767412ec8545c8f3bc9aeb3e5d8b249c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761781799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/33ae9e2767412ec8545c8f3bc9aeb3e5d8b249c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761781799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"de